{"id": 7488, "raw": "<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Links rápidos</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://cal.com/matteocigala/15min\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Marcar uma chamada</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.vivifysports.com/nutritionalcoaching\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Consulta de nutrição com a Marine</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/353834777697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp Matteo</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.skool.com/cigala-cycling-collective-1115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Comunidade no Skool</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A comunidade no Skool é gratuita para os atletas que treino. Ainda não recebeste o convite? <a href=\"mailto:matteo@cigalacycling.com?subject=Skool%20invitation\">Envia-me um email</a> e eu mando-to (vê também a pasta de spam, às vezes vai parar lá).</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">As tuas apps de treino</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>O teu plano está no Vekta e sincroniza com o teu Garmin, Wahoo ou Zwift.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://app.joinvekta.com/me/calendar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Abrir o meu calendário Vekta</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Biblioteca de treino</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Força e core</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7498,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7498\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7498\">Alongamentos e core</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7498\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7499,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7499\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7499\">Circuito de ginásio: inverno, primeiro mês</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7499\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7500,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7500\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7500\">Circuito de ginásio: inverno, segundo e terceiro mês</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7500\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><!-- wp:file {\"id\":7501,\"href\":\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7501\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-file\"><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7501\">Circuito de ginásio: em época</a><a href=\"https://coaching.cigalacycling.com/athletes/?cc_file=7501\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download>Download</a></div><!-- /wp:file --><